 	help
 	  Say Y or M to add support for the fixed internal connection between
 	  the HDMI I2S controller and DesignWare HDMI on Allwinner H3, H5, A64,
-	  and H6 SoCs. This driver configures the SoC-specific link used for
-	  HDMI audio playback. The module will be called sunxi-hdmi.
